{
  "about": "Which of a command's files is a picture, and which pictures each harness takes natively besides the text's list (spec/CONTROL.md §6 `start`, Pictures; spec/ADAPTERS.md). `facts`: a file's signed type and its bytes (base64, as much of the file as the header needs), and the picture facts read from them, or null for a file the text lists and nothing more. `takes`: a picture as saved, and whether the harness is given it natively; `acp` is an agent whose initialize says promptCapabilities.image: true, `claude-code-sdk` a session held through the Agent SDK, `claude-code` claude -p and the in-place lanes. `messages`: several pictures of one message, and the indexes of those the harness is given, in order.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "name": "a PNG",
      "type": "image/png",
      "bytes": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAYwAAACECAYAAAAAAAAA",
      "expect": {
        "type": "image/png",
        "width": 396,
        "height": 132,
        "animated": false
      }
    },
